{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/bd9577c3b1b3a84fb9361f56fb0cef46.avif?t=1762687532\" width=960 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pond is a tyrannical place hardly fit for little Tad-Bubble. Luckily, Tad has the power of the Miracle Bubble on his side! <br>Help Tad fight off waves of dangerous boss bugs, boss fish, and boss more in this GameBoy homebrew. Learn your enemies' patterns, weave between their attacks, and defeat as many bosses as possible! You'll get to heal up in between fights, but be careful, as your supply of Max Leaves and Power Algae is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made using GBStudio. Music and sound effects by Beatscribe. Additional sound effects by Yogi (Tronimal).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially made in 48 hours during the Global Game Jam 2025 with the theme &quot;Bubble&quot;. Winner of the Game of Show award at the GGJ in Groningen, thanks to the wonderful reception from the jammers and guests on site!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/8cdbbd08825c9921ebc8102dba3ab7ce.avif?t=1762687532\" width=1114 height=1000 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016690?t=1762687532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/8e80bba38c747996c857cc163128fbe11728fa34/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762687532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/5883169bd6e3191936f8367ae1cb65dd31d33beb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762687532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/5883169bd6e3191936f8367ae1cb65dd31d33beb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762687532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/bd9577c3b1b3a84fb9361f56fb0cef46.avif?t=1762687532\" width=960 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pond is a tyrannical place hardly fit for little Tad-Bubble. Luckily, Tad has the power of the Miracle Bubble on his side! <br>Help Tad fight off waves of dangerous boss bugs, boss fish, and boss more in this GameBoy homebrew. Learn your enemies' patterns, weave between their attacks, and defeat as many bosses as possible! You'll get to heal up in between fights, but be careful, as your supply of Max Leaves and Power Algae is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made using GBStudio. Music and sound effects by Beatscribe. Additional sound effects by Yogi (Tronimal).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially made in 48 hours during the Global Game Jam 2025 with the theme &quot;Bubble&quot;. Winner of the Game of Show award at the GGJ in Groningen, thanks to the wonderful reception from the jammers and guests on site!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/extras/8cdbbd08825c9921ebc8102dba3ab7ce.avif?t=1762687532\" width=1114 height=1000 /></span></p>","developers":["Gapucho"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016690/2fbfd669a508ade424171226bbbd79fb0d4afb53/header.jpg?t=1762687532","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Tad-Bubble!","package_grou